{
    "version":  21,
    "variables":  [
                      {
                          "version":  2,
                          "key":  "frontend_upstream",
                          "type":  "query",
                          "visible":  true,
                          "editable":  true,
                          "input":  "smartscapeNodes \"FRONTEND\"\n| filter isNotNull(name) and name != \"\"\n| dedup name\n| fields value = name\n| sort value asc\n| limit 500",
                          "multiple":  false
                      },
                      {
                          "version":  2,
                          "key":  "frontend_target",
                          "type":  "query",
                          "visible":  true,
                          "editable":  true,
                          "input":  "smartscapeNodes \"FRONTEND\"\n| filter isNotNull(name) and name != \"\" and name != $frontend_upstream\n| dedup name\n| fields value = name\n| sort value asc\n| limit 500",
                          "multiple":  false
                      }
                  ],
    "tiles":  {
                  "intro":  {
                                "type":  "markdown",
                                "content":  "# RUM Application Topology Comparison\n\n**Build: 2026-09-28-r1 - topology only**\n\nRead each layer from left to right: **UPSTREAM** on the left and **TARGET** on the right. The dashboard uses the current Smartscape catalog only; it does not scan user events, spans, logs, or metrics.\n\nPath used for both sides: `FRONTEND -\u003e SERVICE -\u003e PROCESS`. Process groups are derived from the stable process fields `dt.process_group.id` and `dt.process_group.detected_name` because Process Group is not a separate node in Smartscape on Grail."
                            },
                  "section_configuration":  {
                                                "type":  "markdown",
                                                "content":  "## 01 - FRONTEND CONFIGURATION\n\nCurrent RUM configuration and catalog lifecycle for each selected frontend."
                                            },
                  "upstream_configuration":  {
                                                 "type":  "data",
                                                 "title":  "UPSTREAM - Frontend configuration",
                                                 "description":  "Current Smartscape configuration for the selected upstream frontend.",
                                                 "query":  "smartscapeNodes \"FRONTEND\"\n| filter name == $frontend_upstream\n| fields\n    `Frontend ID` = id,\n    `Frontend name` = name,\n    `Frontend type` = frontend.type,\n    `RUM enabled` = dt.rum.instrumentation.rum.enabled,\n    `Instrumentation ID` = dt.rum.instrumentation.id,\n    `Deleted at` = frontend.deletion_time,\n    `First observed` = getStart(lifetime),\n    `Last observed` = getEnd(lifetime)\n| sort `Frontend name` asc, `Frontend ID` asc\n| limit 20",
                                                 "visualization":  "table",
                                                 "visualizationSettings":  {
                                                                               "autoSelectVisualization":  false,
                                                                               "table":  {
                                                                                             "rowDensity":  "condensed",
                                                                                             "columnWidthStrategy":  "content",
                                                                                             "enableSparklines":  false,
                                                                                             "linewrapEnabled":  true
                                                                                         }
                                                                           },
                                                 "querySettings":  {
                                                                       "maxResultRecords":  500,
                                                                       "defaultScanLimitGbytes":  1,
                                                                       "maxResultMegaBytes":  5,
                                                                       "defaultSamplingRatio":  1,
                                                                       "enableSampling":  false
                                                                   }
                                             },
                  "target_configuration":  {
                                               "type":  "data",
                                               "title":  "TARGET - Frontend configuration",
                                               "description":  "Current Smartscape configuration for the selected target frontend.",
                                               "query":  "smartscapeNodes \"FRONTEND\"\n| filter name == $frontend_target\n| fields\n    `Frontend ID` = id,\n    `Frontend name` = name,\n    `Frontend type` = frontend.type,\n    `RUM enabled` = dt.rum.instrumentation.rum.enabled,\n    `Instrumentation ID` = dt.rum.instrumentation.id,\n    `Deleted at` = frontend.deletion_time,\n    `First observed` = getStart(lifetime),\n    `Last observed` = getEnd(lifetime)\n| sort `Frontend name` asc, `Frontend ID` asc\n| limit 20",
                                               "visualization":  "table",
                                               "visualizationSettings":  {
                                                                             "autoSelectVisualization":  false,
                                                                             "table":  {
                                                                                           "rowDensity":  "condensed",
                                                                                           "columnWidthStrategy":  "content",
                                                                                           "enableSparklines":  false,
                                                                                           "linewrapEnabled":  true
                                                                                       }
                                                                         },
                                               "querySettings":  {
                                                                     "maxResultRecords":  500,
                                                                     "defaultScanLimitGbytes":  1,
                                                                     "maxResultMegaBytes":  5,
                                                                     "defaultSamplingRatio":  1,
                                                                     "enableSampling":  false
                                                                 }
                                           },
                  "section_applications":  {
                                               "type":  "markdown",
                                               "content":  "## 02 - APPLICATIONS / FRONTENDS\n\nThe selected Web Application is represented by a `FRONTEND` node. Both Smartscape and Classic IDs are shown when available."
                                           },
